      "id": "HMT-03",
      "title": "From an invariant-subspace angle to the iterated Hecke norm bound",
      "chapter": "inputs",
      "anchor": "inputs-height-spectral",
      "statement": "A finite coset average v of the translate w satisfies ⟨v,w⟩=‖v‖² on the common cover. The arithmetic angle estimate gives ‖v‖≤(2/5)‖w‖. The two squared norms carry the same positive index. The selected conclusion weakens the norm ratio to 3/5, preserves mean zero, and iterates.",
